---
import { siteUrl } from '../../../utils/site';
import Definition from '../../../layouts/Definition.astro';
import Mermaid from '../../../components/Mermaid.astro';
import StagePreview from '../../../components/screens/StagePreview';
---

<Definition title="Principal's Office" section="Journey">
  <StagePreview
    client:only="react"
    slot="preview"
    glb="assets/stages/city_e/s00e_office/lndmd/s00e_office_m.glb"
    spawn={[0, 0, 8]}
    cameraOffset={[0, 8, 14]}
  />

  <h2>Context</h2>
  <p>First city area new characters see. After character creation, the player spawns here with the "intro" key. The principal briefs the player on their role as a Hunter.</p>

  <h2>Room layout</h2>
  <p>The emulator reference defines a broad raised rear library landing, a central six-step staircase,
    wooden landing and stair railings, tall warm-toned bookcases with leaning library ladders,
    and the turquoise guild sun centered above the Principal’s desk. The small circular dais is superseded.</p>
  <p>The landing MUST support the player at 1.05 m. The central stairs MUST be traversable in both
    directions; a continuous collision ramp may sit behind the visible treads. The Principal MUST stand
    at landing height, remain reachable for interaction, and keep speech bubbles relative to that height.
    The entrance and quest-client positions remain on the lower floor. Shelf ladders are decorative.</p>

  <h2>NPCs</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Principal</strong> — quest briefings, story progression</li>
    <li><strong>Quest client NPCs</strong> — appear based on active quest (Kai, Sarisa, Dorn, Dr. Carlo, etc.)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Exits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Door → <a href={siteUrl('/journey/city/counter')}>Guild Counter</a></li>
  </ul>

  <Mermaid chart={`flowchart LR
    A[Character Customize] -->|intro spawn| B[Principal's Office]
    B --> C[Guild Counter]
  `} />

  <h2>Spawn variants</h2>
  <p>Default: <code>(0, 0, 4.4)</code> facing the desk (−Z). "counter-office" variant spawns near the door from the guild counter.</p>

  <h2>Previous</h2>
  <p><a href={siteUrl('/journey/character-customize')}>← Character Customize</a></p>
</Definition>
